{
  "name": "Live Actions",
  "description": "What we will do for a session that is slipping or not ready: the cause, the plan, an owner and a date.",
  "position": 2,
  "agentPrompts": [
    {
      "key": "propose-action",
      "label": {
        "en": "Propose an action for a session that is slipping",
        "zh-CN": "为一场出问题的直播提出跟进措施"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-live-commerce` skill in this folder and follow it. For the session I name, read its signals and score, explain in two or three sentences what went wrong or what is missing, and add one action with a concrete plan, an owner and a due date. Before a session airs, the date is before the live date.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-live-commerce` Skill，按它的规则做。针对我说的场次，读它的信号和评分，用两三句话说明问题在哪或缺什么，然后加一条跟进措施，写清具体计划、负责人和截止日期。还没开播的，截止日期要在开播之前。"
      },
      "intent": "change"
    },
    {
      "key": "chase-actions",
      "label": {
        "en": "Which live actions are overdue?",
        "zh-CN": "哪些跟进措施已经超期"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "Read the `busa-live-commerce` skill in this folder and follow it. List open actions past their due date with their owner and session, and say whether that session’s score has moved since the action was opened. Do not change anything.",
        "zh-CN": "先阅读本文件夹里的 `busa-live-commerce` Skill，按它的规则做。列出超过截止日期仍未完成的跟进措施、负责人和对应场次，并说明措施开出以后这场直播的评分有没有变化。不要修改任何记录。"
      },
      "intent": "read-only"
    }
  ],
